# About dialog. Check in each look.
rec ab-open 1 ipc panels open about IRICE-TEST
note Compare the open curve with QML (same curve as the session dialog: Material about 0.3 s, Glass about 0.4 s).
wait 1
shot ab-shot
note Same rows and values as QML, labels on the left, values on the right.
key -k Escape
wait 1
shot ab-closed
note Escape closes the dialog; nothing left on screen.
